/T (Selected using validation only: train-only standardisation, k=15, distance voting and the two informative features. One final evaluation on the seed-17, never-tuned test partition gives 90.5% accuracy \(181 of 200 cases\). The measured decline with irrelevant dimensions supports feature filtering/weighting; PCA is an alternative if informative directions are correlated. Selecting k with test data would contaminate the final estimate and inflate apparent generalisation performance. Implemented in Programs/q2_scaling.py; the dataset, seven-by-two sweep, each-seed weighting scores, plot data and final configuration JSON are bundled. The two features used in the final test were fixed before test evaluation. )
/E (Selected using validation only: train-only standardisation, k=15, distance voting and the two informative features. One final evaluation on the seed-17, never-tuned test partition gives 90.5% accuracy \(181 of 200 cases\). The measured decline with irrelevant dimensions supports feature filtering/weighting; PCA is an alternative if informative directions are correlated. Selecting k with test data would contaminate the final estimate and inflate apparent generalisation performance. Implemented in Programs/q2_scaling.py; the dataset, seven-by-two sweep, each-seed weighting scores, plot data and final configuration JSON are bundled. The two features used in the final test were fixed before test evaluation. )
