/T (A linear scan requires O\(N\) similarity comparisons per query, so retrieval latency grows with the number of cases. More cases improve coverage but duplicates can overrepresent a single diagnosis, while conflicting solutions for almost identical contexts may reduce trust. Use exact-duplicate detection, provenance and expert verification on retention; periodically audit rarely useful cases and conflicting recommendations; and build indexes on categorical/ordinal attributes for a larger store. Executable implementation: Programs/q5_cbr.py. )
