/T (The gain is substantial on this generator and matched evaluation, but is not proof the same mutual- information filter will succeed with interacting features or distribution drift. The original all-feature model remains preferable if every recorded attribute is demonstrably predictive, feature scoring is unreliable, or high-dimensional metric learning is already available. A future check should repeat on independent datasets and reserve a separate untouched test for assessing the final redesigned strategy. )
