1191 0 obj
<<
/Title (This assignment investigates instance-based methods, a locally adapted regression estimator, an RBF feature network, case-based retrieval, and deployment under latency and noise constraints. Each result is obtained from the executed Python programs included in the source archive. Tabulated predictions, measured errors and figures are drawn from their CSV/JSON outputs.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1047 0 R
/Next 1290 0 R
>>
