1195 0 obj
<<
/Title (Chosen system: Q2 k-NN with 20 irrelevant features \(22 total\). The two useful measurements are overwhelmed by independent distractors after standardisation. Q2 validation accuracy falls from 91.0% with no distractors to 74.5% with 20; the average nearest/farthest distance ratio rises from 0.0214 to 0.4308. This is primarily feature-representation and distance-concentration failure rather than insufficient training or an intrinsically poor k value.)
/Dest [24 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1049 0 R
>>
endobj
1196 0 obj
<<
