/Title (k-NN is lazybecause it does not estimate a fixed decision equation during training. Fitting stores feature vectors and labels. For a new query, it calculates distances, sorts candidates, chooses the k nearest, thenpredicts the most common class. Here the distance ties are ordered by case ID \(P1 before P2\),and a tied class vote is resolved in favour of the class of the closest neighbour among the tied classes.)
